1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,220
 Here's how you turn 1,000 followers into 10,000 followers.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,360
 You're going to want to be on the Meta Ads Manager to do this.

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:13,060
 Once you're on Meta Ads Manager, go over here to Audiences and then go to Create Audience.

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,540
 And first thing you want to do is create Custom Audience.

5
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,220
 Once you go to this page, click on Instagram Account and hit Next.

6
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:24,180
 Once you're on this page, select your Instagram.

7
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,380
 So as you can see, mine is right about here.

8
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:36,600
 And then go over here to everyone who's engaged with this professional account and click that.

9
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:41,240
 And you can do everyone that's engaged in the last 365 days.

10
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,640
 Name your audience and hit Create Audience.

11
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:51,560
 And then create a lookalike audience from that custom audience that you just created.

12
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,440
 As you can see, this is a custom audience.

13
00:00:54,060 --> 00:01:03,320
 And right now, I'm going to create a lookalike audience based off that specific audience that is already engaging with my videos.

14
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:14,040
 As you can see, 1% of the people similar to who's already engaged in my account equates to 2,780,000 people.

15
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:19,740
 So what this is doing is essentially taking the followers you already have and finding similar followers.

16
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:21,920
 So you can create this audience.

17
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:26,260
 And then you can go into your campaigns.

18
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,620
 And then you can click on campaigns.

19
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:32,040
 And then you can go over here to create a new campaign.

20
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:35,480
 And you can run traffic campaigns with your Instagram.

21
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:39,100
 And you can target that lookalike audience with your ads.

22
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:42,380
 So let's just say you create a campaign right now.

23
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:45,220
 I'm going to show you how to do it.

24
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,200
 Go to Manual Traffic Campaign.

25
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:51,160
 And go over here to Campaign Budget.

26
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:53,240
 Make sure that's turned on.

27
00:01:53,240 --> 00:02:01,540
 And then once you go to the audiences right here, you're going to want to do Instagram, account, and Facebook.

28
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:04,020
 And then go over here to switch to original.

29
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:08,700
 And then go over here to where it says Custom Audiences.

30
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:13,460
 And that's where you put your lookalike and custom audience in there.

31
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:17,720
 So once you have that in there, you can just add the reels you want to show them.

32
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:19,260
 And then you can publish the ad.

33
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:22,880
 And you can turn 1,000 followers into 10,000 followers.

